   <narrative xml:lang="SV">V&#xe4;rldskonferensen Women deliver; Invest in Girls and Women it Pays    ska h&#xe5;llas i Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia 28-30 maj 2013,samla 5000+ med    ett brett deltagare; ministrar, parlamentariker, relig&#xf6;sa ledare,     &#xe4;mnessakkunniga, journalister,EOs m.fl. f&#xf6;r att lyfta fr&#xe5;gan om       kvinnoh&#xe4;lsa med fokus p&#xe5; uppfyllande av millenieutvecklingsm&#xe5;l 5,     minskad m&#xf6;drad&#xf6;dlighet. Resultatet sks ge bidrag till SDGs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women deliver Conference will be held in Kuala Lumpur 28-30 maj 2013  in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia and gather 5000+ participants; ministers,   parlamentariker, religious leaders, NGOs, journalists etc. Focus is   on achivement of MDG 5 maternal mortality. The results aim to give an input to the Sustainable development Goals beyond 2015.</narrative>
